  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.TowerHom.tower_hom | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.TowerHom.tower_hom | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.TowerHom.tower_hom <;> assumption)
